  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.41 “Emergency medical services instructor coordinator (EMS I/C)” means the primary instructor licensed by the division to be responsible for all aspects of division approved training programs.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13953, eff 4-30-24",
